1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,019
Forwards like this reach families across Tamil Nadu every day. But is it true?

2
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:13,008
Pakkam's Rumour Shield checks every claim against the official Government Order.

3
00:00:13,008 --> 00:00:16,320
The amount is false: the order says Rs.1,000.

4
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:18,454
And it flags the scam tricks:

5
00:00:18,454 --> 00:00:21,839
a short link, an OTP request, a fake deadline.

6
00:00:22,939 --> 00:00:27,659
This is Pakkam. Ask in your language, and get the answer with its proof.

7
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:31,561
Just tap the orb and ask, here in Tamil.

8
00:00:33,416 --> 00:00:36,016
(Tamil) “How much is the Magalir Urimai amount?”

9
00:00:37,466 --> 00:00:39,613
Gnani Prisma turns the voice into text.

10
00:00:39,613 --> 00:00:43,466
Pakkam answers from the Government Order, and reads it aloud in Tamil.

11
00:00:43,866 --> 00:00:53,226
(Tamil) “Under Kalaignar Magalir Urimai Thittam, eligible women heads of families get Rs.1,000 a month (Rs.12,000 a year).”

12
00:00:54,627 --> 00:00:56,284
Every answer shows its source.

13
00:00:56,284 --> 00:01:02,307
One tap opens the exact page of the Government Order, the line highlighted, checked against the printed page.

14
00:01:03,911 --> 00:01:09,191
Tanglish, Hindi or English. Every answer comes only from the official documents.

15
00:01:20,846 --> 00:01:23,861
And when the documents don't say it, Pakkam says so.

16
00:01:23,861 --> 00:01:27,165
It never guesses, and points you to the helpline instead.

17
00:01:28,668 --> 00:01:31,313
Under the hood: Gnani Prisma listens.

18
00:01:31,313 --> 00:01:34,317
Hybrid search reads 18 official documents.

19
00:01:34,317 --> 00:01:38,893
Every sentence must cite a page, and every number must be on it.

20
00:01:38,893 --> 00:01:41,468
Then Gnani Timbre speaks the answer.

21
00:01:42,867 --> 00:01:45,879
We tested it live on 194 real questions.

22
00:01:45,879 --> 00:01:53,108
98% of answers cite the correct page, and 39 of 40 out-of-scope questions were honestly refused.
